# Face-down cards, reveals, judge looks and shuffles.
seed 3
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Signal Fire" *30
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *30
crypt C "Tomas Grey" *12
library C "Quick Feed" *30
start

A> draw 3
A> move A:hand:1 ready facedown
expect card A:ready:1 faceDown true
expect sees A A:ready 1
expect sees B A:ready 0
expect sees public A:ready 0
log B A moved a face-down card from their hand to their ready region

A> flip A:ready:1
expect sees B A:ready 1
log B A turned Signal Fire face up

A> reveal A:hand:1
log B A revealed Signal Fire
expect sees B A:hand 0
reject:forbidden B> reveal A:hand:1

# A judge can look at a hidden card; everyone sees that it happened (GAME-03).
reject:forbidden A> look A:library:1
judge> look A:library:1
expect sees judge A:library 1
expect sees B A:library 0
log B A judge looked at a hidden card in A's library
# Shuffling re-keys every card, so the judge loses track of it.
A> shuffle
expect sees judge A:library 0
log B A shuffled their library
